  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.74 Web coating line",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.74 \"Web coating line\" means all of the coating applicator(s), drying area(s), or oven(s), located between an unwind station and a rewind station, that are used to apply coating onto a continuous strip of substrate.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
